  <div class="entry">
    <div class="entry-head">
      <h3>Predictive Maintenance with ESP32</h3>
      <p class="meta">2026 · Independent project</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="bullets">
      <li>Developing a predictive maintenance system with an ESP32, vibration sensors, current sensors and motor drivers for real-time performance analysis.</li>
      <li>Performing hardware assembly, including precision soldering and terminal block wiring, and implementing MQTT with an LCD-based HMI for remote telemetry monitoring.</li>
      <li>Mounting an MPU6050 3-axis accelerometer on a DC motor to capture vibration data over I²C and detect early signs of wear.</li>
    </ul>
    <figure class="poster">
      <img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Poster for the IoT predictive maintenance project: DC motor, MPU6050 accelerometer, ESP32 and MQTT telemetry, with a vibration waveform crossing an alert threshold" width="1100" height="1680" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>Project poster: DC motor, MPU6050 accelerometer, ESP32 and MQTT telemetry.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

